[[Kodan]] is a Dwarven Recruitment Officer, whose duties include being a [[historian]] and a [[hero skill trainer]].

Kodan gives out empty [[Hero's Handbook]]s and [[Master Dungeon Guide]]s (both [[normal mode]] and [[hard mode]] versions) to characters. He also accepts filled books and gives the appropriate Deldrimor rewards for them.

